msgid "A digiKam image plugin to refocus a photograph."
msgstr "កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​រូបថត​សម្រាប់​ផ្ដោត​លើ​រូបថត​ឡើង​វិញ ។"

#: imageeffect_refocus.cpp:75
